            undefined"><div class="undefined TruncatedText TruncatedText_line-4__CGy8m Overview_OverviewDescriptionTruncText__KLEw7 
                 " data-testid="text-custom">RNA NG Palazzo ensures a coveted lifestyle and offers a convenient living. It offers facilities such as Gymnasium, Power Backup. Young families with kids can explore modern-arrangements for leisure and play such as Children&#x27;s Play Area, nearby apart from Swimming Pool. The property has Fire Sprinklers. Some other provisions include access to Multipurpose Room.</div></div></div><div class="Overview_OverviewGrid__OKQXI false"><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Configuration</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">2 BHK</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Ready to move</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Completed in Jul 2020</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">Avg. Price</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">₹12,720/sq.ft</div></div></div><div class="Overview_Separator__72rcU"></div><div><div class="Overview_LabelValue__6n8p7"><div class="undefined Overview_OverviewLabel__SqP8W text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">RERA Carpet Area</div><div class="undefined Overview_Value__mQWHK text_text-14px__aPnkg" data-testid="text-custom">1305 - 1555 sqft</div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="Overview_ListContainer__RcPDE "><div class="Overview_highlightHeading__8JSvd">Why consider <span>buying this property</span>?</div><div class="Overview_HighlightsContainer__cYf_c"><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>Access to important landmarks.</li><li>Schools, hospitals, educational institutes, restaurants, banks, and a movie theatre are all nearby.</li><li>Kandivali is easily accessible via the Western Express Highway, S V Road, and Link Road.</li></ul><ul class="Overview_Squarelist__NXH7D"><li>The club house, children&#x27;s play area, cycling and jogging tracks are among the amenities.</li><li>Kandivali railway station is 2.4 kilometres away.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id="AIReviewSummary"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Container__cdZ_7 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_Header__Z33Z1"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleWrapper__VrIqs"><div class="AIReviewSummary_TitleRow__RxyFc"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_Title__r4_AU"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-3__6qV5j" data-testid="text-custom">Google AI Summary</div></h2><span class="AIReviewSummary_Sparkle__4AIGg">✦</span></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_AiBadge__yHMUt"></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ContentWrapper__H1KTG" style="max-height:380px"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_SummaryText__LoG_f text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Project Status: The development faced significant historical stalls and delays, leading the high court to grant flat buyers permission to self-develop the remaining structure. Location and Layout: The property is situated in the Dahanukar Wadi area of Kandivali West and comprises spacious layouts primarily configured as two bedroom units.</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Grid__9zT79"><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="up-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The good things</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Connectivity Benefits</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The property offers convenient access to major arterial routes, public transport buses, auto-rickshaws, and the local metro line.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Proximity to Amenities</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The complex is situated close to necessary social infrastructure including prominent educational institutes, healthcare facilities, markets, and supermarkets.</div></div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_PointsCard__WtPbt  Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="AIReviewSummary_CardHeader__W5nac"><img alt="down-thumb" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="AIReviewSummary_CardIcon__x8doc" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg"/><h3 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm AIReviewSummary_CardTitle__3bBl_"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">Needs improvement</div></h3></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Major Construction Delays</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The project experienced severe setbacks and prolonged stalled construction work after structural development halted mid-way.</div></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_Item__1e62m"><span class="AIReviewSummary_Bullet__YwiF8"></span><div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemTitle__lg3YU text_desktop-body__tJn8c" data-testid="text-custom">Traffic Bottlenecks</div><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_ItemDesc__VLroL text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">The surrounding external roads connecting to main highways experience high vehicular density and heavy congestion during rush hours.</div></div></div></div></div><div><hr class="AIReviewSummary_Divider__md7XZ"/><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_VerdictLabel__jEfM0 text_desktop-heading-5__YAUk5" data-testid="text-custom">The Verdict</div><div class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTags___OivB"><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Avoid due to execution risk</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Good layout sizes</div></span><span class="AIReviewSummary_VerdictTag__XMXZK"><div class="undefined  text_desktop-body-sm__qq5_7" data-testid="text-custom">Well connected location</div></span></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_FadeOverlay__CFpBd" style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="AIReviewSummary_ToggleContainer__OfGS6 "><button class="AIReviewSummary_ViewMoreBtn__LXBrc"><div class="undefined AIReviewSummary_BtnText__a2mA5 text_mobile-cta__98PCA" data-testid="text-custom">REVEAL FULL SUMMARY</div><span class="AIReviewSummary_BtnIcon__HS5CT">✦</span><div class="AIReviewSummary_Shimmer__D9tsE"></div></button></div></div></section><section id="Amenities"><div class="Amenities_Amenities__Idw7g" data-testid="blox-Amenities"><div class="Amenities_AmmCard__Gu2e5 Card_secondary__V9lZX Card_BloxCard__LQ6Yv" style="height:auto;width:auto" data-testid="blox-card"><div class="Amenities_AmenitiesHeadingTxt__bxyH0 squarebx rightPos"><h2 class="text_Htitle__vsNcm "><div class="undefined  text_text-20px__KiVZf" data-testid="text-custom">Amenities</div></h2></div><div class="Amenities_amenitiesDesktop__NRcWU"><div class="Amenities_TagGrid__rI9__"><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/gym-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg"/><div>Gymnasium</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/indoor-games-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg"/><div>Indoor Games</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/jogging-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg"/><div>Jogging / Cycle Track</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg"/><div>Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits</div></div><div class="Amenities_IconLabel__WOGsG"><img alt="amenities/large-green-area-secondary" decoding="async" data-testid="next-image-ctn" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" src="/assets/icons/amenitie