er\",\"text\":\"The amenities are Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of RNA Palazzo?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of RNA Palazzo is RNA Corp.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"RNA Palazzo\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/170223113747-newproject-38.webp\",\n  \"description\": \"RNA NG Palazzo ensures a coveted lifestyle and offers a convenient living. It offers facilities such as Gymnasium, Power Backup. Young families with kids can explore modern-arrangements for leisure and play such as Children's Play Area, nearby apart from Swimming Pool. The property has Fire Sprinklers. Some other provisions include access to Multipurpose Room.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"RNA Corp\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/rna-palazzo\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"16600000.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"17100000.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/rna-palazzo\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800002906\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/rna-corp-1a256b13a1461\",\n    \"name\": \"RNA Corp\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/rna-palazzo\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"RNA Palazzo\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/rna-palazzo\",\n      \"name\": \"RNA Palazzo\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"RNA Palazzo, Ahead of Dahanukar